  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Kaede: “Leo’s Ghost is Adam Smith’s Theory of Moral Sentiments—seeking ‘sympathy’ from others. Millia’s Ghost is J.S. Mill’s liberty of the individual, plus Japan’s patriarchal ‘chain of ancestors.’ Two Ghosts are tearing her apart.”",
    "ja": "Kaede「LeoのGhostはアダム・スミスの道徳感情論。他者からの\"共感\"を求める哲学。MilliaのGhostはJ.S.ミルの個人の自由と、日本の家父長制の\"祖霊の鎖\"。二つのGhostが彼女を引き裂いてる」"
  },
